    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert lucide-alert-circle" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10">
      </circle>
      <line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12">
      </line>
      <line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16">
      </line>
    </svg>
  </span>
  <p class="ap-state__title">문제가 생겼습니다</p>
  <p class="ap-state__guidance">서버에서 처리하지 못했습니다 — 잠시 뒤 다시 시도하세요.</p>
